        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "7 months ago",
        "text": "Excellent work ethic and reasonable prices! Adriano is a great communicator and a perfectionist, so he delivers top notch results. Highly recommend him and his team!",
        "time": 1752621752,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Josh B",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117134043256721107347/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXErt1BlkjGWCVxI6C5-Y5LQX7ay8QJqTBbL4D1wo-8ookH4sBD=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 months ago",
        "text": "Adriano has done excellent work for us - TWICE. He's punctual, reliable, communicates well, and makes an effort to ensure the home owner understands the work and is happy with the end result. We happily recommend him to others needing all kinds of contractor-type work done!",
        "time": 1761944006,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "andrée donald",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107982950008066116636/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocL8LoSAvYeoX9qV3rR43wfUqW8qrk657SMDgyHm0C4Egjzo2A=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "5 months ago",
        "text": "After a flood damaged my basement, I got three quotes from different contractors, all for around the same price. I chose Hercules Construction because Adriano, the owner, was so easy to talk to. As a young entrepreneur, I wanted to give him a chance—and I’m glad I did!\n\nAdriano was flexible, extremely clean, and made sure to protect all my floors and doorways throughout the project. You can really tell he cares about his customers’ satisfaction and is willing to go the extra mile to make sure you’re happy.\n\nI would definitely recommend Adriano and Hercules Construction for anyone looking for quality workmanship and a trustworthy contractor!",
        "time": 1756050553,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Ivan S",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104165042852882170162/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKddPv62BOlVY98vXnx5YP9LDbpwhdHCB-VOFKpGjaFKRJjZw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "A absolutely pleasure to work with. Very detail-oriented and the estimate was extremely thorough. Amazing work with renovating our basement! Highly recommend!",
        "time": 1765542575,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Michel Gagné",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106768925258287079744/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjW6vEhSd-_q9mD-tTH2ICIDoDsAwa1WVGue0V0jSs3wY14s8xBs=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
